    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a quick summary for a school paper? i need to explain why multilateral trade agreements (like the ones the WTO handles) are generally considered beneficial for the modern world economy. just a few paragraphs on the main perks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
